WEBVTT

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.900
I can't, it's too dangerous to get any closer!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.670
We are unable to approach from above
due to severe air turbulence.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:14.330
It has been announced that US armed forces
are now hurrying towards the affected areas,
We are unable to approach from above
due to severe air turbulence.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.100
It has been announced that US armed forces
are now hurrying towards the affected areas,
All communications with Tokyo
have been completely cut off!

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.940
in compliance with a request for assistance
issued by the Self-Defense Force.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.350
Sera...

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.320
The girl, she...

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.220
she protected all of us!

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.140
No, girl!

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:57.110
Don't do it! I don't know what's going on,
but you're overdoing it!

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:59.580
There are cracks in your body!
Cut it out!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.480
Forget about us, just get out of here!

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.110
You all...

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.850
Thank you all.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.960
She thanked us.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.400
Even though she's the one that helped us...

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:22.030
Oh, girlie, you just may have been an angel.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.500
Her name is Sera Rikudo.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.240
I'll bet she becomes the wind,
and keeps an eye on you.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.140
Hey, sonny...

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:31.610
Where ya going?

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.740
Gotta become the wind myself.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.910
He's waiting, you see.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:45.850
I pray in the dark

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:57.660
Ima tsumetai kaze ni fukarete

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:06.110
Futo miushinatta jibun wo mita

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:10.680
Iroasete kiete yuku

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.920
Kao no nai hitogomi no naka de

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:18.990
Utagoe wa todokanai

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:24.220
Kakikesarete shimau kara

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.800
Kotaete

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:31.000
Inori wa hakanaku

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.310
Kiekakesou na negai

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:41.750
Itami wa kesenai kedo

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:47.950
Kotoba de hikari wo atsumeru

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:52.260
Kanata e todoku you ni

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:58.900
Namida wa kesenai kedo

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:04.490
I pray in the dark

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:10.940
C'mon, say it.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.380
This is just a dream, isn't it?

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.780
Right?!

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.350
This... This is...

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.480
Is this our Tokyo?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.410
The Ninth Night

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:21.880
Stars of Fate Chapter

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.580
Story of Seiryu ~
Gathering Stars of Fate

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.060
Are we the only ones left?

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.360
I'm sorry.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.060
It was the most we could do
just to protect you all.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.400
No!

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.940
Then what about my father and my mother?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.240
What about the others?!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.870
Calm down, Miss Komaki.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.830
I doubt that every single person
in Tokyo is dead, but...

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.710
This was Ryuji's power, wasn't it?

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
Yes...

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.380
There was all that light gathering inside him.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:57.090
Actually, power flowed into all of our bodies.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.790
What the hell's up with that?

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.990
The time of Chi You draws near.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.790
The time of Chi You?

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.430
It is a time that occurs once every
two thousand years,

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.400
when the Dragons of Heaven and Earth
call out to each other,

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:09.840
and activate the Dragon Stream
to an abnormal degree.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:15.240
And this time shall come on the very
moment the new year begins.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.210
That means it's gonna happen
three hours from now.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.170
And then...

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:25.480
What more could possibly happen now?

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.850
Who in the world is Yashiro?

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:33.930
Yagyu intends to absorb the boy's powers
and make them his own.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.160
His powers?

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.130
Gramps, who the heck is he?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.100
The vessel of the Golden Dragon.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.170
I remember hearing something about that.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.870
The Golden Dragon is one who is gifted with
the power of the Dragon Stream,

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.240
the great energy at the very center of all creation.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:54.850
It is said that when the powers of the Four Dieties,
Seiryu, Suzaku, Genbu and Byakko,

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.480
have been gathered, this individual will awaken.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.750
That guy...

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.660
Ryuji Yashiro is its vessel then?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:06.590
That... that can't be!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.960
The power of the Four Guardians
has not awakened!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.300
That time when l... It was just...

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.830
Daigo...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.370
He is the Golden Dragon's shadow,

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.970
the Vessel of the Yin.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:21.440
His method of awakening would naturally be
different from that of his Yang counterpart.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.210
Vessel of the Yin...

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.480
The two Vessels do not exist
simultaneously in the same world.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.880
However, in certain rare instances,

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:32.720
the two Vessels of the Yin and Yang
are born at the same moment.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.390
Ryuji Yashiro is the Vessel of the Yin.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.690
And the Vessel of the Yang is...

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:40.880
No way!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.150
Tatsuma?

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.200
Yes, Tatsuma Hiyu.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.800
You are the Vessel of the Yang.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.310
You harbor the power of the
Dragon Stream within you;

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:57.010
you are the one who governs reason.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:01.210
Your parents were both born under special stars.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:05.020
The Stars of Fate dictated that
you be born as the Vessel.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:08.090
The changes of mind and body that
you have been through

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:11.990
are proof that your powers as the
Vessel have begun to awaken.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:16.960
Yagyu's goal is the complete
destruction of this world.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:20.400
He wishes to nullify the existence
of all things, without exception.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.100
The devestation here was just the quickening.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.940
In other words, it's just getting started.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.540
Tatsuma, you are the one who is able to stop it.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.540
Only you, the Vessel of the Yang,

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.840
and these others whom the Stars
call to fight alongside you!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:49.060
There are no historical accounts of the Vessel
of the Yin actually having been born.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:55.270
The very existence of this vessel
has been dubious at best.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:59.900
Thanks to that, we weren't able to
figure out that's what he is.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.970
Jeez, I'm ashamed of myself...

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:07.450
I suspect coming into contact with the Vessel
of the Yang and having his soul awoken

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:12.080
is the key to awakening the Vessel of the Yin.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.890
Yagyu did figure out that Ryuji
is the Vessel of the Yin,

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:20.530
and manipulated him into meeting Tatsuma.

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:23.600
The place where the unification ceremony
will be conducted

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.400
is where the Dragons of Heaven and Earth
call upon each other to converge:

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.800
the sacred mountain, Fuji.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:39.680
Sakurai?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:43.250
I was thinking maybe I'd find something
I could use as a weapon,

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.550
'cuz I lost my bow somewhere.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.190
They're alive.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:55.630
My dad and my mom and my little brothers,
they're all alive for sure!

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.500
So, I'll fight...

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.460
I'll fight!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:03.200
Yes, and I will too!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.170
For the people who are still alive.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:13.240
I'd like to live in a nice, white brick home!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.050
Oh, made of fireproof materials, of course.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.510
The curtains will have a strawberry pattern,

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.520
so that it will kinda be like a big piece of
strawberry shortcake if you look at it real quick!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.490
Hey, so what do you prefer to sleep in:
a futon or a bed?

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:26.520
Oh, stop! You're taking this
way too fast, Tatsuma!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.330
Great God of the spiritual realm,
have mercy on us, bless us...

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:34.530
Spirit of blessing, miraculous spirit,
protect us, save us...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.870
I'm gonna do it!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.840
I can do it! I will!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.870
What is it, Maiko?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:45.410
I've never been to Mount Osore!

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.410
Pardon?

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:50.280
See, I've decided to visit all the
spiritual places in Japan.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:53.080
When this is all over, why don't
we both go together?

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.720
Okay?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.520
S..Sure...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.130
So tell me...

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.030
Why is this the only place that's all right?

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.840
Since ancient times, this place has been
the pivot point of the earth currents.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:17.300
Guardians have kept a watchful eye
over it throughout the ages.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.910
Guardians?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.710
I would like to ask you something.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:35.880
Why were you unable to fully seal away
Yagyu seventeen years ago?

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.300
Because all were not present.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.640
I mean all those whom we were to fight with.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.770
That right?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.570
Well anyhow, you old guys sit this one out, okay?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:54.880
To be honest, you'll only get in the way.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.840
Plus, there might be some stuff that will
need taking care of when this is over.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:04.290
So, others will get ahead of us again, huh?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.090
Jeez, if it's not one thing, it's another!

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:11.060
Don't you go giving us more trouble to deal with!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.370
Is that... It can't be!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.970
Oh, looks like they made it in time.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.510
And the water heater,
I guess we could do without.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.130
Won't need any heating either!
Oh, an oven...

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.470
Koni?!

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.450
You!

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.750
Master Miroku!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.050
So, you are all right?

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:37.990
I'm afraid I don't have the strength to fight, but...

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.790
We have brought you new weapons.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:44.250
As well as others to fight alongside you.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.830
You...

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.800
Honor demands that we join you.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.600
We will join you!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.840
Mibu...

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:57.240
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.980
Long time, no see, Kyochee.

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:00.950
Dammit, don't call me that!

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.020
You too?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.200
Kyouichi!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.770
Oh, hey, you're just in time.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.390
U..Um...

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.900
What's this for?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.470
Hang onto that for me for a little bit, okay?

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.440
Uh, okay...

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:33.210
Um, hey, can I take a picture?

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.740
Oh, children who bear Stars of Fate...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.380
Come back...

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.020
Come back to us alive and well!

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:50.630
No good!

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:53.260
We're being pulled in by the earth current!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.300
We're going down!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.330
Find something to hang onto!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.500
Ryuji?

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.800
Or is it Munetaka Yagyu?

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.150
We can win, can't we?

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:13.380
Hiyu is the Vessel of the Yang, right?

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:17.340
Then, we can win for sure, right?

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:23.290
Tatsuma's powers won't awaken unless
the Four Dieties are assembled.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.900
Byakko and Seiryu are here,

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.900
but as for Genbu and Suzaku...

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:30.840
Daigo is the one with Byakko's power.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.240
So, then there's someone else too?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:37.610
Indeed, however, even if the
powers are awakened,

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.210
our enemy is a devilish creature

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:44.150
who has battled those with the Stars of Fate
far and wide, and for many years,

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.950
I'm afraid.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.150
What's more,

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:52.820
when that boy's powers as
Vessel were awakened...

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.400
Evil one, begone from this place!

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:07.470
A square barrier? How crude.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.110
Die!

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.900
A hayakuji?!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:13.750
You fools.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.610
No magical barrier is going to
work on one such as l,

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.420
who has obtained knowledge of
all this world's sorcery!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.120
If you truly consider yourselves warriors,

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.420
then take me on in hand-to-hand combat!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.460
Well, if that's what you have to say...

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.250
...we'll show you what the Martial Fist can do!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.990
W..Wait!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:28.890
Don't rush in!

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.430
You morons!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.230
Have a little control, dammit!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.670
I fight to protect!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.140
What?

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.390
Damn...

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.080
No way...

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.150
Tatsuma!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:32.610
Why you dirty, stinkin' old pedophile!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.860
Foolish Suzaku,

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:39.160
you may die as Kozunu did,
without fulfilling your Star of Fate!

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.290
Tatsuma...

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.330
Go!

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.270
Tatsuma!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.240
Heh, that's supposed to be Byakko?

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:05.120
We'll negate his field using the
power of lchiji Kinrin!

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.130
Use the opportunity to launch a concerted attack!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.750
Om!

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.190
Bazara!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.130
Daruma!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:12.760
Kiriku!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.960
This is rather entertaining.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.670
Sakurai!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.780
What the heck...

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.280
It can't be...

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.910
Hina!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.910
Hina...

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.350
Lady Aoi!

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:40.120
Hang on, Maiko! Maiko!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.360
Sonnuva bitch...

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.860
Can't we even scratch him?

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.570
If ya got the time to complain,

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:50.330
use it to recharge, lightning bastard!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.270
All of our attacks get deflected back at us!

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:56.900
Jeez, this deflectin' sonnuva bitch
sure is a piece of work.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:00.240
Okay, take a good look now.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.380
Check out his left eye.

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:05.350
We won't get anywhere if we don't seal its power!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.350
Hey, Sagaya!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:09.150
Can you get into his mind?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.460
Send Tatsuma's voice inside him,
where it can get to Yashiro!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.590
In the meantime, we'll crush that eyeball of his!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.530
That power...

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:26.500
Master, I'm sorry, but let me use
the power one more time!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.900
Ryuji!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.040
Ryuji!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.620
Ryuji!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.750
Open your eyes, Ryuji!

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.930
Ryuji!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.570
Ryuji!

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:01.540
You who harbor the powers of the Vessel...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:05.680
Will you transcend time and face
me once again in this place?

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:08.250
Ryuji, snap out of it!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.510
En garde!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.640
Ryuji! You are Ryuji Yashiro!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.860
You're not slipping away!

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.190
Bastard!

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.250
You're comin' down with me!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.230
Ryuji, open your eyes!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.200
You're not Munetaka Yagyu!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.830
Tatsuma!

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:41.870
I'm with ya!

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:52.220
Kyouichi...

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:55.190
Kyouichi!

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:58.200
This is the end for you too!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.200
Hey, you, whatcha doin'?

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.500
Get up.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.200
You're...

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.640
If you don't get up,

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.070
what will happen to all the others?

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:11.410
Stand up! Hurry up!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.500
You're...

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.090
What's that?

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.860
The Four Dieties...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.890
They've been assembled!

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.360
That means...

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:34.160
The Vessel has awoken.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:51.950
Ah, you've awoken?

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:53.640
Interesting...

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.320
I'll take you on!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.360
Is this Hiyu?

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.160
Is it Hiyu?

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:19.810
The awakened Vessels and those
drawn into their plane...

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:23.110
This is their battle?

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:42.060
Hiyu!

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.710
Did he lose?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.950
Did Hiyu lose?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.140
The Vessel of the Golden Dragon...

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.480
I promised...

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.420
I promised him.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.500
Hiyu?

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.460
I promised that I'd make him laugh.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.190
So...

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.660
So!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.750
Stand up!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.220
Stand now, you who bear Stars of Fate.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:37.820
You must stand and fight!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:42.990
To bring the smiles back to people's faces,
and restore the world to life!

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.220
We will get back up again and again!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.770
We will not let any more lives be lost!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.170
We do it for the sakes of those
we could not protect,

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.400
as well as the countless people
who have been hurt!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.050
Munetaka Yagyu!

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.180
We will not be defeated!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:07.820
We will stand and fight again and again,

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.810
as many times as it takes to destroy you!

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:43.980
Yuko?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:52.690
Hirasaka?

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.210
Good grief, you're a mess.

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:08.680
But you're going to protect everyone,
right, Tatsuma Hiyu?

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.980
Then, let's get going, man.

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:15.950
It's to protect...

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:21.350
To protect!

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:23.430
That we fight!

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:25.220
Let's go!

00:22:41.850 --> 00:22:46.950
Kanashige ni sukoshi utsumuite

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.650
Yatto kimi wa tsubuyaita

00:22:52.060 --> 00:23:01.230
Kasuka ni kikoeta no wa seiippai no sayonara

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.170
Fushizen na chinmoku no naka

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:12.440
Hibiku bokura no kodou

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:16.810
Mata aeru meguriaou yo

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:22.620
Sorezore no asu wo sagashi ni deyou yo

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:27.120
Setsunasa ni yasashisa kureta

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:31.560
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:37.370
Marude sou kono hanabira ga

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:43.010
Tabidachi wo shukufuku shiteru you sa

00:23:43.010 --> 00:23:47.380
Sabishisa wo tsutsunde kureta

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:51.840
Nukumori wasurenai

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:57.750
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:07.460
